WEBVTT

00:03:27.851 --> 00:03:33.500
It's no wonder many working people
turned against meritocratic elites.

00:03:34.506 --> 00:03:36.220
So what should we do?

00:03:36.609 --> 00:03:40.664
We need to rethink three aspects
of our civic life.

00:03:41.331 --> 00:03:42.641
The role of college,

00:03:42.665 --> 00:03:44.244
the dignity of work

00:03:44.268 --> 00:03:45.982
and the meaning of success.

00:03:47.149 --> 00:03:51.297
We should begin by rethinking
the role of universities

00:03:51.321 --> 00:03:54.000
as arbiters of opportunity.

00:03:55.583 --> 00:04:00.460
For those of us who spend our days
in the company of the credentialed,